  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e2effc6c8484a4541877dbfe23a82f8a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story4NPC2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - name: Shooter
    text: Training tells you to decide fast. Faster than thought. You see movement,
      you see a shape, and your body finishes the sentence before your brain does.
  - name: Shooter
    text: "Told myself I followed procedure.\r\nThen I saw his name. Where he worked.
      How long he\u2019d been on the force. I didn\u2019t see a colleague."
  - name: Shooter
    text: "I saw a threat. That wasn\u2019t instinct. That was learned\u2026 Why
      did I feel so confident in that moment?..."
